### Manual test requests for voucher-service.
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
### then click "Send Request" above any request.
### Restart the app to reset the sample data.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Campaign 1 stats (check remainingStock before/after)
GET {{host}}/campaigns/1/stats

### 2. user-1 redeems first voucher -> OK
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0001/redeem?userId=user-1

### 3. user-1 redeems second voucher -> OK
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0002/redeem?userId=user-1

### 4. user-1 third voucher -> FAILED, limit reached (2)
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0003/redeem?userId=user-1

### 5. Different user, same voucher still available -> OK (limit is per user)
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0003/redeem?userId=user-2

### 6. user-1 in a different campaign -> OK (limit is per campaign)
POST {{host}}/vouchers/MRDK-0001/redeem?userId=user-1

### 7. user-99 already has 1 REDEEMED + 1 VOID on campaign 1.
###    VOID does not count, so one more is allowed -> OK
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0006/redeem?userId=user-99

### 8. Blank userId -> FAILED, "userId is required"
POST {{host}}/vouchers/MRDK-0002/redeem?userId=

### 9. Already-redeemed voucher -> FAILED (existing behaviour)
POST {{host}}/vouchers/RAYA-0004/redeem?userId=user-3

### 10. Inactive campaign -> FAILED (existing behaviour)
POST {{host}}/vouchers/EXPD-0001/redeem?userId=user-3

### 11. Stats for all ACME campaigns
GET {{host}}/campaigns/by-client/ACME/stats
